---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import OpenEvoSdLoraHistorySeriesNav from './OpenEvoSdLoraHistorySeriesNav.astro';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { SD_LORA_V2_LOCAL } from '../../data/sdLoraV2Outcome';
import {
  SD_LORA_BOUNDED_RECURRENCE_RESULT as result,
  SD_LORA_BOUNDED_RECURRENCE_SOURCE as source,
  SD_LORA_VR_LINEAGE_INDEX as lineage,
} from '../../data/sdLoraVrLineages';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const root = '/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/';
const sourceBase = `https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/${source.commit}`;
const planHref = `${sourceBase}/${source.planPath}`;
const q0Href = `${sourceBase}/${source.q0CloseoutPath}`;
const q1Href = `${sourceBase}/${source.q1CloseoutPath}`;
const lineageHref = `https://github.com/${lineage.repository}/blob/${lineage.commit}/${lineage.path}`;
const stableHref = p(`${root}sd-lora-equivalence/`);
const successorHref = p(`${root}bounded-effective-state-gdr/`);
const accelerationHref = p(`${root}sd-lora-bounded-acceleration/`);
const postAdvisorHref = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/597';
const capacityEvidenceHref = '/research/seed-openevo/evidence/post-advisor-ab-final-20260928.json';
const mib = (bytes: number) => (bytes / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1);
---
<article class="bounded" data-copy-review data-sd-lora-bounded-recurrence>
  <header class="bounded__hero">
    <p class="bounded__eyebrow">{t('07 / 07 · rank32 容量筛查 · R152–R159 matched continuation', '07 / 07 · rank32 capacity screen · matched R152–R159 continuation')}</p>
    <h1>{t('固定状态需要多大容量？', 'How much capacity does a bounded state need?')}</h1>
    <p class="bounded__lede">{t(
      '在同一续训窗口中，rank32 使用约四分之一的持久参数 payload，并保留大部分已观测行为；严格无损或 non-inferiority 尚未得到证明。',
      'Across a matched continuation window, rank32 uses about one quarter of the persistent parameter payload and retains most observed behavior; strict losslessness and non-inferiority are not established.',
    )}</p>
    <figure class="bounded__capacity-figure" data-bounded-capacity-result aria-labelledby="capacity-figure-title">
      <figcaption id="capacity-figure-title">{t('仅比较持久 adapter payload；rank32 续训筛查', 'Persistent adapter payload only; rank32 continuation screen')}</figcaption>
      <div class="bounded__capacity-bars" aria-label={t('rank32 payload 约为 rank128 的四分之一', 'rank32 payload is about one quarter of rank128')}>
        <div><span>rank128</span><span class="bounded__bar bounded__bar--128"><span class="sr-only">100%</span></span><strong>205,551,528 B</strong><small>196.0 MiB</small></div>
        <div><span>rank32</span><span class="bounded__bar bounded__bar--32"><span class="sr-only">25%</span></span><strong>51,410,296 B</strong><small>49.0 MiB</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bounded__capacity-outcomes">
        <p><span>{t('Task Score 均值', 'Mean Task Score')}</span><strong>0.6298 → 0.6119</strong><small>Δ −0.0179 · 95% CI [−0.0368, 0.0012]</small></p>
        <p><span>{t('Exact Success', 'Exact Success')}</span><strong>341 / 1024 → 350 / 1024</strong><small>Δ +0.0088 · 95% CI [−0.0137, 0.0313]</small></p>
      </div>
    </figure>
    <p class="bounded__boundary" data-bounded-capacity-boundary>{t(
      '范围：同一 R152–R159 task / seed schedule 的 1,024 个配对 rollout；点估计与区间都不能确立无损或 non-inferiority。容量只涉及持久 payload，不代表总模型内存或运行速度；protected final panel 未访问。下一步扫 rank16 / 32 / 64 / 128。',
      'Scope: 1,024 paired rollouts on the same R152–R159 task / seed schedule. Neither the point estimates nor intervals establish losslessness or non-inferiority. This covers persistent payload only, not total model memory or runtime; the protected final panel was not accessed. Next, sweep rank16 / 32 / 64 / 128.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="bounded__next-question"><a href="#rank32-capacity">{t('查看压缩来源、匹配方法与完整证据 →', 'Read the compression origin, matched method, and full evidence →')}</a></p>
    <p class="bounded__next-question"><a href="#capacity-next">{t('下一步：rank16 / 32 / 64 / 128 容量 sweep →', 'Next: rank16 / 32 / 64 / 128 capacity sweep →')}</a></p>
    <nav class="bounded__links" aria-label={t('本页证据', 'Evidence for this page')}>
      <a href={q1Href}><ExternalBrandMark href={q1Href} />{t('Q1 最终 closeout', 'Q1 final closeout')}</a>
      <a href={lineageHref}><ExternalBrandMark href={lineageHref} />{t('两条 SD-LoRA 线索索引', 'Two-line SD-LoRA lineage index')}</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="bounded__next-question"><a href={successorHref}>{t('写入控制仍是独立问题：容量扫清以后再决定 alpha / beta →', 'Write control remains a separate question: settle capacity before deciding on alpha / beta →')}</a></p>
  </header>

  <section class="bounded__section" aria-labelledby="lineage-title">
    <h2 id="lineage-title">{t('两条加速路线改的是不同东西', 'The two acceleration lines change different things')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      'Stable Reduction 仍然保留不断增加的历史 component，只把跨 component 的归约规则写得更稳定、更适合并行；Bounded Online Recurrence 则把历史折进固定 rank128 状态。两个结果都有效，但不能把 2× 和 37× 当成同一个实现的两次测速。',
      'Stable Reduction still retains the growing component history and makes cross-component reduction explicit and parallel-friendly. Bounded Online Recurrence instead folds history into one fixed rank128 state. Both results are valid, but the ~2× and ~37× numbers are not two timings of the same implementation.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="bounded__table-wrap">
      <table class="bounded__table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">SD-LoRA v2 · Stable Reduction</th><th scope="col">SD-LoRA · Bounded Online Recurrence</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('历史怎么保存', 'How history is stored')}</th><td>{t('历史 component 继续逐个保留', 'Historical components remain individually retained')}</td><td>{t('历史折成一个固定 rank128 状态', 'History is folded into one fixed rank128 state')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('每轮主要改动', 'Main per-round change')}</th><td>{t('chunk 16；跨 component 用 FP32 累加', 'chunk 16; FP32 cross-component accumulation')}</td><td>{t('学习 rank8 新更新，再压回 rank128', 'learn a rank8 update, then compress back to rank128')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('代表性 trainer 结果', 'Representative trainer result')}</th><td>{SD_LORA_V2_LOCAL.eightStepSpeedup.toFixed(2)}× {t('（matched 8-step）', '(matched eight-step)')}</td><td>{result.formalSpeedupMean.toFixed(2)}× {t('平均（R151–R159）', 'mean (R151–R159)')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('核心结论', 'Core conclusion')}</th><td>{t('更快的稳定数值 treatment', 'faster stable numerical treatment')}</td><td>{t('固定大小的在线参数状态', 'bounded online parameter state')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="bounded__related"><a href={stableHref}>{t('查看 Stable Reduction 的 2× 结果和 WebShop 小面板 →', 'See the Stable Reduction ~2× result and small WebShop panel →')}</a></p>
    <p class="bounded__related"><a href={accelerationHref}>{t('后续加速研究：主要时间花在训练还是压缩？→', 'Follow-up acceleration study: does training or compression dominate runtime? →')}</a></p>
  </section>
  <section class="bounded__section" aria-labelledby="recurrent-title">
    <h2 id="recurrent-title">{t('R150 到 R159 没有回到 Vanilla', 'R150 through R159 never reset to Vanilla')}</h2>
    <p class="bounded__baseline" data-bounded-rank128-baseline>{t(
      '历史基线：rank128 状态连续 9/9 gate PASS；同轮 Vanilla trainer 平均约 37×。这是独立的 R150–R159 资格窗口，不是 rank32 对照的运行速度。',
      'Historical baseline: the rank128 state passed 9/9 gates, with about 37× mean same-round Vanilla trainer speedup. This is a separate R150–R159 qualification window, not a runtime comparison for the rank32 fork.',
    )}</p>
    <figure class="bounded__flow">
      <div class="bounded__flow-line" role="img" aria-label={t('R150 bounded 状态连续更新到 R159，每轮保持 rank128', 'The bounded R150 state updates continuously through R159 while remaining rank128')}>
        <span>R150 · r128</span><b>→</b><span>R151</span><b>→</b><span>R152</span><b>→</b><span>…</span><b>→</b><span>R159 · r128</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption>{t(
        `每一轮只把上一轮 bounded 输出当作 prior；新经验仍是 rank${result.currentUpdateRank} update。Q1 的九轮没有从 full Vanilla checkpoint 重置。`,
        `Every round used only the previous bounded output as its prior; new experience still entered as a rank${result.currentUpdateRank} update. None of the nine Q1 rounds reset from a full Vanilla checkpoint.`,
      )}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p>{t(
      `adapter 文件在九轮里始终是 ${mib(result.adapterModelBytes)} MiB；每个 optimizer step 平均 ${result.secondsPerOptimizerStepMean.toFixed(3)} 秒。logical history 从 150 增长到 159 时，step 时间对历史长度的线性斜率只有 ${result.historySlope.toExponential(2)} 秒 / round。`,
      `The adapter stayed ${mib(result.adapterModelBytes)} MiB across all nine rounds; each optimizer step averaged ${result.secondsPerOptimizerStepMean.toFixed(3)} seconds. As logical history grew from 150 to 159, the fitted step-time slope was only ${result.historySlope.toExponential(2)} seconds per round.`,
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="bounded__section" aria-labelledby="behavior-title">
    <h2 id="behavior-title">{t('四个行为检查都守住了预先门槛', 'All four behavior checks stayed inside the frozen margins')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      'score 的非劣门槛是 lower bound ≥ -0.05；完整成功率的门槛是 lower bound ≥ -0.0625。R150、R152、R155、R159 都在实验前冻结的规则下 PASS。',
      'The score non-inferiority rule was lower bound ≥ -0.05; the exact-success rule was lower bound ≥ -0.0625. R150, R152, R155, and R159 all passed under rules frozen before evaluation.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="bounded__table-wrap">
      <table class="bounded__table bounded__table--numbers">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Round</th><th scope="col">Score LB</th><th scope="col">Success LB</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {result.behavior.map((row) => (
            <tr><th scope="row">R{row.round}</th><td>{row.scoreLowerBound.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{row.successLowerBound.toFixed(4)}</td><td><strong>PASS</strong></td></tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bounded__section" aria-labelledby="capacity-title" id="rank32-capacity">
    <h2 id="capacity-title">{t('rank32 容量筛查：从哪里来、能说明什么', 'Rank32 capacity screen: its origin and what it supports')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '后续容量实验没有重跑历史 rank128，而是从同一个 sealed R151-after 状态做 deterministic rank32 compression，然后沿完全相同的 R152–R159 task / seed schedule 继续 8 轮、进行 1,024 个配对 rollout。它比较容量，不是重新做一次 DirectApply-vs-Bounded。',
      'The follow-up capacity experiment did not rerun historical rank128. It deterministically compressed the same sealed R151-after state to rank32, then continued for eight rounds on the exact same R152–R159 task / seed schedule with 1,024 paired rollouts. It compares capacity, not DirectApply-vs-Bounded.',
    )}</p>
    <dl class="bounded__metrics" aria-label={t('rank32 容量实验主要结果', 'Headline rank32 capacity results')}>
      <div><dt>{t('rank32 持久 payload', 'rank32 persistent payload')}</dt><dd>49.0 MiB</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('rank128 大小', 'rank128 size')}</dt><dd>196.0 MiB</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('大小比例', 'Size ratio')}</dt><dd>0.250×</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="bounded__table-wrap">
      <table class="bounded__table bounded__table--numbers">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">rank128</th><th scope="col">rank32</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('R152–R159 平均 Task Score', 'Mean Task Score, R152–R159')}</th><td>0.6298</td><td>0.6119</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('Exact Success', 'Exact Success')}</th><td>341 / 1024</td><td>350 / 1024</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('持久参数 payload', 'Persistent parameter payload')}</th><td>205,551,528 B</td><td>51,410,296 B</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="bounded__claim">{t(
      '通俗地说：把持久参数盒子从 rank128 缩成 rank32 后，payload 约为四分之一，大部分已测行为仍被观察到。Task Score 点估计低约 0.0179，但区间跨过 0；目前尚未证明严格无损或 non-inferior，也不能据此断言 rank128 配置过大。',
      'In plain terms: shrinking the persistent parameter box from rank128 to rank32 leaves about one quarter of the payload, with most measured behavior still observed. The Task Score point estimate is about 0.0179 lower, but its interval crosses 0; strict losslessness and non-inferiority remain unproven, and this does not establish that rank128 is over-provisioned.',
    )}</p>
    <p id="capacity-next">{t(
      '配对 rank32 − rank128 Task Score 差为 −0.0179，bootstrap 95% CI 为 [−0.0368, 0.0012]；exact-success-rate 差为 +0.0088，95% CI 为 [−0.0137, 0.0313]。因此现在最合理的下一步是先扫 rank16 / 32 / 64 / 128 的容量曲线，再决定是否值得继续复杂 alpha / beta；不能因为后验 rank95≈8 就跳到“rank8 已经够用”。',
      'The paired rank32 − rank128 Task Score difference is −0.0179 with bootstrap 95% CI [−0.0368, 0.0012]; the exact-success-rate difference is +0.0088 with 95% CI [−0.0137, 0.0313]. The next clean step is therefore a rank16 / 32 / 64 / 128 capacity sweep before adding richer alpha / beta control; posterior rank95≈8 is not evidence that rank8 is sufficient.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="bounded__boundary">{t(
      '证据身份说明：更早的 rank32 纵向 S3a 资格筛查在 R155 未通过预设 score margin；它与这里的后续 R152–R159 matched capacity fork 是不同实验和证据面板，不能合并成同一个 rank32 结论。',
      'Evidence identity: an earlier longitudinal rank32 S3a qualification screen failed its prespecified score margin at R155. It is a different experiment and evidence panel from this later R152–R159 matched capacity fork; do not combine them into one rank32 result.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="bounded__related"><a href={postAdvisorHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={postAdvisorHref} />{t('Post-advisor rank32 最终收口 · PR #597 ↗', 'Post-advisor rank32 final closeout · PR #597 ↗')}</a>{' · '}<a href={capacityEvidenceHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t('BaseModel 本地证据镜像 ↗', 'BaseModel local evidence mirror ↗')}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="bounded__section" aria-labelledby="claim-title">
    <h2 id="claim-title">{t('现在能说什么', 'What this result supports')}</h2>
    <p class="bounded__claim">{t(
      '在封存的 R150–R159 历史窗口里，SD-LoRA 的逻辑历史继续增长，但维护的参数状态可以固定在 rank128，旧 component 数 K 不再让这条 history-dependent update path 越来越重。',
      'Within the sealed R150–R159 historical window, SD-LoRA logical history keeps growing while the maintained parameter state stays rank128, so the old component count K no longer makes this history-dependent update path grow heavier.',
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '边界同样重要：这不是 Vanilla 的逐 bit 数值等价证明，也不是所有任务、所有历史长度或所有 continual-learning 方法都能 O(1) 更新的证明。每轮 wall time 仍受样本和 token 数影响；protected final panel 没有被打开。',
      'The boundary matters just as much: this is not bitwise numerical equivalence to Vanilla, nor a proof that every task, history length, or continual-learning method admits O(1) updates. Per-round wall time still depends on examples and tokens, and the protected final panel was not opened.',
    )}</p>
    <details class="bounded__evidence">
      <summary>{t('证据与源码', 'Evidence and source')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={q0Href}><ExternalBrandMark href={q0Href} />Q0 one-step closeout</a> · {result.q0Speedup.toFixed(2)}×</li>
        <li><a href={q1Href}><ExternalBrandMark href={q1Href} />Q1 R151–R159 final closeout</a> · {result.formalSpeedupMean.toFixed(2)}× mean</li>
        <li><a href={planHref}><ExternalBrandMark href={planHref} />{t('Bounded-state / recurrence 总计划', 'Bounded-state / recurrence master plan')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={lineageHref}><ExternalBrandMark href={lineageHref} />{t('SD-LoRA / VR 双线索引', 'SD-LoRA / VR two-line lineage index')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </section>

  <OpenEvoSdLoraHistorySeriesNav locale={locale} />
</article>
<style>
.bounded{width:100%;padding:0 0 4rem}.bounded__hero,.bounded__section{width:min(980px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto}.bounded__hero{padding:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3rem) 0 1.3rem}.bounded__eyebrow{margin:0 0 .55rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .82rem/1.3 var(--font-mono)}.bounded__hero h1{max-width:18ch;margin:0;font-size:clamp(2rem,5.2vw,4rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.04em}.bounded__lede,.bounded__boundary,.bounded__baseline,.bounded__section>p,.bounded__flow figcaption{max-width:48rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55}.bounded__lede{margin:.65rem 0 0;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1rem,1.8vw,1.18rem)}.bounded__capacity-figure{max-width:52rem;margin:1rem 0 0;padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface-muted)}.bounded__capacity-figure>figcaption{font-size:.84rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--muted)}.bounded__capacity-bars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-top:.65rem}.bounded__capacity-bars>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:.22rem .5rem;align-items:center;font-size:.88rem}.bounded__capacity-bars strong,.bounded__capacity-bars small{grid-column:1/-1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.bounded__capacity-bars small{color:var(--muted)}.bounded__bar{display:block;height:.6rem;background:var(--accent-deep)}.bounded__bar--128{width:100%}.bounded__bar--32{width:25%;min-width:1.3rem}.bounded__capacity-outcomes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7rem;margin-top:.75rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.bounded__capacity-outcomes p{display:grid;gap:.12rem;margin:.6rem 0 0;font-size:.83rem}.bounded__capacity-outcomes strong{font-size:.96rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.bounded__capacity-outcomes small{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}.bounded__boundary{margin:.7rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.bounded__baseline{margin:.55rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.bounded__next-question{margin:.55rem 0 0;line-height:1.45}.bounded__next-question a,.bounded__links a,.bounded__related a,.bounded__evidence a{color:var(--accent-deep);text-underline-offset:.2em}.bounded__metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0;margin:1rem 0 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.bounded__metrics div{padding:.8rem .8rem .8rem 0}.bounded__metrics dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.bounded__metrics dd{margin:.2rem 0 0;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800}.bounded__links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 1rem;margin-top:.75rem}.bounded__section{padding-top:2.2rem}.bounded__section h2{max-width:26ch;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.15rem);line-height:1.15}.bounded__table-wrap{margin-top:1rem;overflow-x:auto}.bounded__table{width:100%;min-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse}.bounded__table th,.bounded__table td{padding:.8rem .7rem;font-size:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.5}.bounded__table thead th{border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.bounded__table tbody th{width:18%;color:var(--muted);font-weight:650}.bounded__table--numbers{min-width:520px}.bounded__table--numbers td,.bounded__table--numbers th{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.bounded__related{margin-top:1rem}.bounded__flow{margin:1.25rem 0 0;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.bounded__flow-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;overflow-x:auto;padding:.2rem 0 .6rem;font:750 1rem/1.2 var(--font-mono)}.bounded__flow-line span{flex:0 0 auto;padding:.5rem .6rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--surface-muted)}.bounded__flow-line b{color:var(--accent-deep)}.bounded__section>.bounded__claim{font-size:1.12rem;color:var(--ink);font-weight:650}.bounded__evidence{max-width:48rem;margin-top:1rem}.bounded__evidence summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}.bounded__evidence li{margin:.55rem 0;line-height:1.5}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:680px){.bounded__hero,.bounded__section{width:min(100% - 1rem,980px)}.bounded__capacity-figure{padding:.7rem}.bounded__capacity-bars{gap:.6rem}.bounded__capacity-outcomes{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.4rem}.bounded__capacity-outcomes p{font-size:.78rem}.bounded__capacity-outcomes strong{font-size:.84rem}.bounded__metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bounded__metrics div{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bounded__metrics div:last-child{border-bottom:0}.bounded__table{min-width:640px}}
</style>
